\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Effect of the reusable channel-bank size under matched feature erasures: $p_{\rm  tr}=p_{\rm  ch}=0.5$, $n=512$, and $d=8$. Curves show means over three initialization/channel-bank seeds; shading shows one sample standard deviation and points retain individual seeds. The data, number of optimizer updates, and deployment law are fixed across $m$. Perfect-trained references are reused across bank sizes. The right panel isolates the observed channel generalization gap in normalized-loss units.}}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
